  _headline: "Reservat\xF3rios secam e racionamento \xE9 decretado"
  _headlineEn: Reservoirs run low; rationing declared
  _body: "A seca esvazia as represas, e a cidade busca novas fontes. A prefeitura
    pede economia e, pela primeira vez, ningu\xE9m discorda."
  _bodyEn: Drought is draining the dams, and the city seeks new sources. City Hall
    asks for savings and, for once, nobody argues.
